            <ArticleTitle>Left main coronary artery aneurysm.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>115-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Left main coronary artery aneurysm is rare finding at coronary angiography. We report a case of a large left main coronary artery aneurysm in a 59-year-old male who had cardiac catheterization for effort angina and inducible myocardial ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
